{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs34 A-Lift\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Four-band "encode-only" lift, in the spirit of running a source through an A-type noise-reduction encoder without decoding it. Each band gets about +10 dB well below Threshold (about +14 dB at the very top), fading as the signal gets louder.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Custom GUI with a per-band lift meter. Knobs: drag (Shift = fine), mouse wheel, double-click to reset; click a value to type it. LINK THR trims Output while you turn Threshold so the level stays roughly constant.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 GUI widgets: tk-gui-tools library (tk_gui_tools.jsfx-inc), installed alongside the plugin.\par}
}
